{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product of all real <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Root_(polynomial)\" title=\"Root (polynomial)\">roots</a> of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/7/ae73ea6028defb63d23a25b692ef98a7671303e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\log_{10}{x}}=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/2/a929d440591bd3f47a8805be375cd5487ab7f8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }-1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 10 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }10^{-1} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"492\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Take the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">logarithm</a> base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> of both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/b/feb0de6efcb158c93cc0953abdefd3ab54fef688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}x=\\log_x10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />. Use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Change_of_base_formula\" title=\"Change of base formula\">change of base formula</a> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0240d14b6c89b59177b08b84b54737623d203a8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}x=\\frac{\\log_{10}10}{\\log_{10}x}=\\frac{1}{\\log_{10}x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"215\" height=\"42\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/94455d3f40a2c108de8a2e90c857080cf98894a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_{10}x)^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c0520d51416c27beb426486e4162aee3d3dce409.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}x=\\pm1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/9679a4292408c502e5801a3e4e63d87321f1b595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6fe560571299e3355c3dfcd78c3b635ae7851362.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10^1=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" /> and from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/3/1137da7e564d401a901d6c2133986cd6bd0bebd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e413c15013c2c89fcbd586ef58d9c1438e7f6631.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10^{-1}=\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"115\" height=\"37\" />. The product is thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e711f2059e32f2286b177e258bf745c00227e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\times\\frac{1}{10}=1, \\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHS